# seafoam.skin — pale aquatic daylight, teal ink on foam white, sandy accents
name seafoam

# light dither, foam texture on the desktop
texture ~

# desktop: cyan (teal) dither over white — daylight, not night
desk 3 15

# paper: white bg, teal ink — the default readable body
paper 15 3

# dialog: light-cyan bg, black ink — accent pane, still daylight
dialog 11 0

# framePassive / frameActive / menu deliberately OMITTED — this is a light
# skin, chrome derives to the classic black-on-white default rather than
# fighting the daylight palette with a dark bar.

dim 8
# accent: brown/sand slot for a warm counterpoint to all the teal
accent 6
floor 3 15

ok 10
warn 4

# no pal remap — authentic CGA. cyan/light-cyan already read as sea teal,
# brown already reads sandy, so the stock 16 colours do the work unaided.
